# The whole etc/ directory is mounted over the image's, so this file has to be supplied here too --
# the server refuses to start without it. Only what the server actually demands: it attaches to its
# own VM for JMX and fails at startup without this flag. The image's heap and GC tuning is left out
# deliberately; the tests query a few hundred records.
-Djdk.attach.allowAttachSelf=true
